<title>USA: U.S. barley weekly export sales highlights--USDA.</title>
<headline>U.S. barley weekly export sales highlights--USDA.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-06-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>USDA barley export sales highlights in latest reporting week:</p>
<p>Net sales of 22,500 MT were 12 percent above the week earlier. Increases reported for Saudi Arabia (57,500 MT) and Japan (20,000 MT) were partly offset by decreases for unknown destinations (55,000 MT).</p>
<p>Exports of 57,500 MT were all to Saudi Arabia.</p>
</text>
